WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:26.370
The handsome frog glared at Tom.

2
00:00:26.371 --> 00:00:32.201
The fat frog ate lots of flies.

3
00:00:32.202 --> 00:00:38.689
The fierce frogs started to fight.

4
00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:52.029
The shy frog hid under the table.

5
00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:55.782
"Try a kiss," Cat whispered to Tom.

6
00:00:55.783 --> 00:00:59.922
"Good idea, Cat!" Tom said.

7
00:00:59.923 --> 00:01:02.853
He turned to Princess Mary.

8
00:01:02.854 --> 00:01:06.582
"A kiss might undo the spell," he said.

9
00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:09.998
"A kiss?" The princess made a face.

10
00:01:09.999 --> 00:01:12.429
The king frowned at her.

11
00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:16.578
"Kiss the princes, Mary!" he yelled.

12
00:01:16.579 --> 00:01:21.372
Tom caught one of the frogs.

13
00:01:21.373 --> 00:01:24.947
Mary kissed it. "Ugh!"

14
00:01:24.948 --> 00:01:28.681
Tom watched the frog.

15
00:01:28.682 --> 00:01:32.200
But the frog stayed a frog!

16
00:01:32.201 --> 00:01:36.074
Dirk laughed loudly.

17
00:01:36.075 --> 00:01:43.443
"Tom will never undo this spell!" he said.

18
00:01:43.444 --> 00:01:47.957
"I will make a potion," Tom said.

19
00:01:47.958 --> 00:01:58.909
He hurried to the Royal Lab.

20
00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:03.521
Tom mixed some things together.

21
00:02:03.522 --> 00:02:06.485
The potion turned black.

22
00:02:06.486 --> 00:02:12.334
Then . . . Boom! The potion exploded!

23
00:02:12.335 --> 00:02:17.412
"Oh no," Tom moaned.

24
00:02:17.413 --> 00:02:20.982
"Those princes will be frogs forever.

25
00:02:20.983 --> 00:02:24.263
I will be put in the Grim Dungeon.

26
00:02:24.264 --> 00:02:29.631
There will be a Royal War!"

27
00:02:29.632 --> 00:02:34.378
"Cat, this is all my fault," Tom said.

28
00:02:34.379 --> 00:02:41.981
Cat rubbed against Tom's hand.

29
00:02:41.982 --> 00:02:45.855
"You have a good heart," she said.

30
00:02:45.856 --> 00:02:49.645
"We can find a way to undo your spell."

31
00:02:49.646 --> 00:02:54.868
Cat licked her paws slowly.

32
00:02:54.869 --> 00:02:59.143
"Hmm . . . ," she said at last.

33
00:02:59.144 --> 00:03:06.481
"I have an idea."
